00:39:32.680 --> 00:39:35.380
of The Office onto these video iPods.
《办公室》的剧集了。

999
00:39:35.540 --> 00:39:37.500
Again, this was not planned.
再说一次，这并非预先计划好的。

1000
00:39:37.680 --> 00:39:43.420
And then The Office became the number one downloaded show on iTunes.
然后《办公室》就成了iTunes上下载量排名第一的剧集。

1001
00:39:43.740 --> 00:39:44.280
Yes.
是的。

1002
00:39:44.640 --> 00:39:46.160
The number one downloaded show.
下载量排名第一的节目。

1003
00:39:46.160 --> 00:39:50.520
I remember Rainn Wilson turned to me and said, I think we're going to make it.
我记得雷恩·威尔森转过头对我说，我觉得我们要成功了。

1004
00:39:51.000 --> 00:39:52.040
I think we're going to.
我觉得我们会成功的。

1005
00:39:52.180 --> 00:39:56.020
This was the first moment it felt like the tide was turning for us and that we might not
这是第一次感觉局势开始好转，我们可能不会

1006
00:39:56.020 --> 00:39:56.660
get canceled.
被砍掉了。

1007
00:39:56.960 --> 00:39:57.340
All right.
好吧。

1008
00:39:57.480 --> 00:40:03.480
So next up, Michael gets his gift, the oven mitt knitted by Phyllis.
接下来，迈克尔收到了他的礼物，菲利斯织的隔热手套。

1009
00:40:03.760 --> 00:40:04.040
Oof.
哎哟。

1010
00:40:04.520 --> 00:40:06.880
Now, everyone had a $20 limit, you guys.
大家伙儿，当时每个人都有20美元的预算限制。

1011
00:40:07.040 --> 00:40:10.980
That's why this iPod really shakes everything up, because he spent $400.
这就是为什么这个iPod真的把一切都搞乱了，因为他花了400美元。

1012
00:40:10.980 --> 00:40:12.380
Yes, yes.
没错，没错。

1013
00:40:13.060 --> 00:40:18.520
And he has his line where he says, I only, he says, out in the hallway, he's holding the
