But it was established there, and it sat there.
但它就那么摆在那儿，一直没动过。

1034
00:41:08.640 --> 00:41:13.260
Well, Phil Shea told me he found a woman at a knitting store in Valley Village, California,
菲尔·谢伊告诉我，他在加州山谷村的一家编织店里找了一位女士，

