她织了这个隔热手套。

1036
00:41:17.120 --> 00:41:23.220
Again, oven mitt knitter, if you're listening, please write us at officeladiesatearwolf.com,
再说一次，隔热手套的编织者，如果你在听的话，请写信给我们 officeladies@earwolf.com，

1037
00:41:23.280 --> 00:41:24.420
and we'll give you a shout out.
我们会为你大声喝彩的。

1038
00:41:24.620 --> 00:41:24.860
Yeah.
没错。

1039
00:41:25.080 --> 00:41:26.280
You knitted the famous mitt.
你织了那只著名的手套。

1040
00:41:26.280 --> 00:41:30.040
I thought it looked like a great oven mitt, and it had like the little like a-
我觉得那看起来是个很棒的隔热手套，而且它还有那种小小的……

