00:41:31.140 --> 00:41:32.620
Teflon-y thingy on the one side.
一面有特氟龙材质的东西。

1043
00:41:32.840 --> 00:41:33.020
Yeah.
是的。

1044
00:41:33.480 --> 00:41:40.020
So Ryan gets the iPod, and at 8 minutes, 24 seconds is the next phase of Angela pissed-offness.
所以瑞安拿到了iPod，在8分24秒时，安吉拉的愤怒进入了下一个阶段。

1045
00:41:40.240 --> 00:41:40.500
Okay.
好的。

1046
00:41:40.740 --> 00:41:47.200
You see my face at the fact that Michael spent $400 when the limit was 20.
你看到了我对于迈克尔在限额20美元的情况下花了400美元的表情。

1047
