00:41:58.340 --> 00:42:03.680
Now two, Michael has spent $400 instead of the agreed upon $20.
第二，迈克尔花了400美元，而不是约定好的20美元。

1050
00:42:04.160 --> 00:42:05.740
So we're ramping up.
所以矛盾正在升级。

1051
00:42:05.980 --> 00:42:07.180
She's getting ticked off.
她快要发火了。

1052
00:42:07.440 --> 00:42:13.200
I have no doubt that you sent a very detailed email about this to everyone with a follow-up
我毫不怀疑你肯定给每个人都发了一封关于此事的详细邮件，还附带了

