她的影像没有出现在任何地方的监视器上。

1877
01:15:37.560 --> 01:15:38.000
That's right.
那是对的。

1878
01:15:38.000 --> 01:15:40.620
And there was no chip in the digital camera.
而且数码相机里也没有存储卡。

1879
01:15:40.900 --> 01:15:42.400
So the flash goes off.
所以闪光灯亮起时，

1880
01:15:42.400 --> 01:15:43.960
It looks like Michael's taking a picture.
看起来像是Michael在拍照，

1881
01:15:44.120 --> 01:15:46.440
But there was actually never a picture taken.
但实际上根本没有拍下照片。

1882
01:15:46.720 --> 01:15:47.080
Never a photo.
一张照片都没有。

1883
01:15:47.240 --> 01:15:52.380
So they were very, very mindful of taking care of Kate in that moment.
所以他们在那个时刻非常、非常用心地照顾Kate。

1884
01:15:52.940 --> 01:15:56.900
Kate would go on as Meredith to take off her clothes.
Kate后来作为Meredith的角色，确实脱了不少衣服。

1885
01:15:57.260 --> 01:15:57.960
Quite a bit.
相当多。

1886
01:15:58.060 --> 01:15:58.520
Quite a bit.
相当多。

1887
01:15:58.840 --> 01:16:04.240
One of my favorite things is that Kate's father wrote her a handwritten letter.
我最喜欢的一件事是，Kate的父亲给她写了一封亲笔信。

1888
01:16:04.520 --> 01:16:05.420
Oh, my goodness.
天哪。

1889
01:16:05.820 --> 01:16:10.420
And all it said, this is her father, who, you know, Kate is from Pennsylvania.
信里只写了——这是她父亲，你知道，Kate来自宾夕法尼亚州——

1890
01:16:10.420 --> 01:16:15.940
And all it said was, dear Kate, stop taking your clothes off.
信里只写着：亲爱的Kate，别再脱衣服了。

1891
01:16:16.240 --> 01:16:17.180
Love, dad.
爱你的，爸爸。

1892
01:16:17.440 --> 01:16:18.620
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

1893
01:16:19.780 --> 01:16:20.980
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

1894
01:16:21.960 --> 01:16:23.580
What did Kate do?
Kate是怎么做的？

1895
01:16:23.740 --> 01:16:24.920
How did she respond to that?
她是怎么回应的？

1896
01:16:24.940 --> 01:16:26.260
She was like, oh, man.
她当时反应是，天呐。

1897
01:16:26.680 --> 01:16:29.160
Now, is that her dad having a sense of humor?
那么，那是她父亲在幽默吗？

1898
01:16:29.160 --> 01:16:31.760
Or is that him being like, seriously, stop it?
还是他真的在说，说真的，别再这样了？

1899
01:16:31.940 --> 01:16:32.700
I think both.
我觉得两者都有。

1900
01:16:32.880 --> 01:16:33.440
I think both.
我觉得两者都有。

1901
01:16:33.440 --> 01:16:33.920
All right.
好吧。

1902
01:16:34.060 --> 01:16:35.520
Should we talk about the parking lot?
我们要聊聊停车场那场戏吗？

1903
01:16:35.760 --> 01:16:37.240
We're almost done here.
我们快聊完了。

1904
01:16:37.820 --> 01:16:38.200
Yes.
好的。

1905
01:16:38.360 --> 01:16:39.520
Let's talk about the parking lot.
我们来聊聊停车场那场戏吧。

1906
01:16:39.660 --> 01:16:45.620
Because it is definitely one of the most magical moments that I remember in filming all nine years.
因为那绝对是我九年拍摄生涯中最神奇的时刻之一。

1907
01:16:45.640 --> 01:16:46.980
And we all say that.
我们大家都这么说。

1908
01:16:47.240 --> 01:16:47.460
Yeah.
是啊。

1909
01:16:47.620 --> 01:16:51.020
People often ask, like, what were your favorite scenes?
人们经常问，你最喜欢的场景是什么？

1910
01:16:51.340 --> 01:16:54.080
And it's always hard to explain.
这总是很难解释。

1911
01:16:54.080 --> 01:16:57.800
Because sometimes your favorite scene, it doesn't seem like that exciting of a scene.
因为有时候你最喜欢的场景，看起来并没有那么令人兴奋。

1912
01:16:57.800 --> 01:17:01.280
But it's what happened behind the scenes that make it your favorite.
但正是幕后发生的事情让它成为了你的最爱。

1913
01:17:01.440 --> 01:17:03.180
And this parking lot scene is one of mine.
而这个停车场场景就是我的最爱之一。

1914
01:17:03.800 --> 01:17:04.180
Definitely.
绝对是。

1915
01:17:04.720 --> 01:17:04.980
Definitely.
绝对是。

1916
01:17:05.460 --> 01:17:05.740
Okay.
好的。

1917
01:17:05.760 --> 01:17:07.400
So it's the end of the day.
那天拍摄结束了。

1918
01:17:07.540 --> 01:17:09.780
We have all of this real snow on the ground.
地上铺满了真实的积雪。

1919
01:17:10.180 --> 01:17:11.680
And everyone is leaving.
大家都准备离开了。

1920
01:17:11.680 --> 01:17:13.340
And everyone's in good spirits.
每个人的兴致都很高。

1921
01:17:13.600 --> 01:17:14.820
And it's really nighttime.
而且天已经完全黑了。

1922
01:17:15.180 --> 01:17:17.560
It was rare for us to ever work past 6 p.m.
我们很少在下午6点以后工作。

1923
01:17:17.580 --> 01:17:18.840
So we always got excited.
所以我们总是很兴奋。

1924
01:17:19.120 --> 01:17:23.520
To walk out in the dark, I think, we all felt like we were up past our bedtime.
走在夜色中，我觉得我们都感觉像是过了睡觉时间还没睡。

1925
01:17:23.820 --> 01:17:26.300
But also, you have to remember, this is Los Angeles.
但你也要记住，这里是洛杉矶。

1926
01:17:26.300 --> 01:17:28.440
There's never snow on the ground.
地上从来不会有雪。

1927
01:17:28.660 --> 01:17:33.720
So this is magical in itself that we have a parking lot full of snow.
所以停车场里满是积雪，这本身就很神奇。

1928
01:17:34.100 --> 01:17:42.360
And as we're walking to the cars, I don't know, like, the shot you see, I'm actually in the front passenger seat of an SUV.
当我们走向汽车时，我不知道，就像你看到的那个镜头，我其实坐在SUV的前排副驾驶座上。

1929
01:17:42.580 --> 01:17:44.660
But I'm only half in, like, the door's open.
但我只坐了一半，车门开着。

1930
01:17:44.860 --> 01:17:49.340
But I remember one of the guys just picked up some snow and flung it at the other one.
我记得其中一个人抓起一把雪扔向另一个人。

1931
01:17:49.500 --> 01:17:54.720
And then they all started picking up snow and having this impromptu snowball fight.
然后他们都开始抓雪，打起了即兴的雪仗。

1932
01:17:54.840 --> 01:17:55.000
Yeah.
是啊。

1933
01:17:55.000 --> 01:17:56.720
And everyone loved it.
大家都玩得很开心。

1934
01:17:56.820 --> 01:17:58.300
And they wanted us to keep doing it.
他们还想让我们继续打。

1935
01:17:58.400 --> 01:18:03.060
But it was just sort of like us just all hanging out in the snow.
但那感觉就像是我们大家在雪地里玩耍一样。

1936
01:18:03.340 --> 01:18:03.580
Yeah.
是啊。

1937
01:18:03.760 --> 01:18:05.760
And we turned into a bunch of kids.
我们都变成了一群孩子。

1938
01:18:05.980 --> 01:18:06.320
We did.
确实如此。

1939
01:18:06.340 --> 01:18:06.940
We couldn't help it.
我们情不自禁。

1940
01:18:07.060 --> 01:18:07.340
Yeah.
是啊。

1941
01:18:07.480 --> 01:18:10.660
We were up past our bedtime with snow on the ground.
我们过了睡觉时间还没睡，地上还铺着雪。

1942
01:18:11.020 --> 01:18:12.060
Fresh snow on the ground.
地上铺着新鲜的积雪。

1943
01:18:12.060 --> 01:18:13.560
It was so fun.
太好玩了。

1944
01:18:13.560 --> 01:18:20.440
And, you know, I have a picture of all of us together in the parking lot with Charles McDougal.
你知道，我有一张我们所有人一起在停车场和查尔斯·麦克道格的合影。

1945
01:18:20.900 --> 01:18:22.320
And it's great.
那张照片棒极了。

1946
01:18:22.520 --> 01:18:23.140
I love it.
我爱死它了。

1947
01:18:23.180 --> 01:18:24.040
I covet it.
我视若珍宝。

1948
01:18:24.220 --> 01:18:25.160
I covet it.
我视若珍宝。

1949
01:18:25.160 --> 01:18:25.300
I love that.
我喜欢那个。

1950
01:18:25.380 --> 01:18:26.200
I want to see it.
我想看看它。

1951
01:18:26.340 --> 01:18:26.620
Yeah.
是啊。

1952
01:18:26.900 --> 01:18:30.240
Well, this is why we have to make our scrapbook thingy, Angela.
嗯，这就是为什么我们得做那个剪贴簿，安吉拉。

1953
01:18:30.500 --> 01:18:30.840
We do.
确实。

1954
01:18:30.880 --> 01:18:31.600
We should combine.
我们应该合在一起做。

1955
01:18:31.780 --> 01:18:32.820
Well, that's what we need to do.
嗯，这就是我们需要做的。

1956
01:18:32.820 --> 01:18:36.220
We need to compile and combine all of our stuff.
我们需要把所有的东西整理并汇总起来。

1957
01:18:36.500 --> 01:18:36.550
All of our photos.
我们所有的照片。

1958
01:18:36.840 --> 01:18:39.880
And then make it so that we can both have what we both have.
然后把它做出来，这样我们俩都能拥有我们共同拥有的东西。

1959
01:18:40.340 --> 01:18:40.740
Yeah.
是啊。

1960
01:18:41.160 --> 01:18:41.520
Right?
对吧？

1961
01:18:41.740 --> 01:18:42.060
Yeah.
是啊。

1962
01:18:42.320 --> 01:18:42.540
Yeah.
没错。

1963
01:18:42.700 --> 01:18:44.920
Before we lose it all, we need to do it.
在弄丢之前，我们得把它做出来。

1964
01:18:45.540 --> 01:18:45.940
Okay.
好的。

1965
01:18:46.120 --> 01:18:46.900
It's 2020.
现在是2020年了。

1966
01:18:48.220 --> 01:18:49.500
We need to do this.
我们得完成这件事。

1967
01:18:49.580 --> 01:18:50.700
This is a goal for this year.
这是今年的一个目标。

1968
01:18:50.780 --> 01:18:52.540
I'm setting the goal for us this year.
我把这定为我们今年的目标。

1969
01:18:52.680 --> 01:18:54.300
Well, you guys, she said it.
好吧，各位，她都发话了。

1970
01:18:54.480 --> 01:18:57.400
Now I've got to, like, Jenna's going to put me to task.
