1990
01:19:48.960 --> 01:19:52.380
So next week, we've got another big episode, Ange.
所以下周，我们还有另一集重头戏，安吉。

1991
01:19:52.380 --> 01:19:53.200
Huge episode.
超级重头戏。

1992
01:19:53.200 --> 01:20:00.460
I mean, listen, the rest of this season two is just going to be one momentous episode
我是说，听着，第二季剩下的部分将会是接连不断的

